This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The SupertonicTTS model weights are not distributed here. They are released by
Supertone under the OpenRAIL-M licence, which carries use restrictions, and you
obtain them directly from https://huggingface.co/Supertone/supertonic-2 under
that licence. A style vector extracted with this code is meaningless without
those weights, so the restrictions that come with them apply to what you do
with it.

The example recordings in examples/ come from the Common Voice subset of
Seed-TTS Eval and are released under CC0, a public domain dedication.
